  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Curated reproducibility package for the manuscript "Source-Aware Evaluation
  of RTL Area and Timing Prediction with Prospective Confirmation." Version
  1.1.0 adds post-hoc robustness scripts and saved outputs that re-score frozen
  predictions and intervals without model refitting, recalibration or
  reselection. The repository contains compact frozen prediction-level data,
  manuscript-facing evidence tables, closure records and scripts for checking
  reported metrics, while deliberately excluding the full historical research
  archive and third-party RTL whose redistribution rights are uncertain.
  Source code is licensed under MIT; original data tables, prediction records,
  result tables, metadata and documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0 as
  specified in the repository licensing files.
